es choses dernières", "section_mg": "Ny fampianarana momba ny farany"}, {"number": 27, "title_fr": "27. Le millénium et la fin du péché", "title_mg": "27. Ny Arivo Taona sy ny Fiafaran''ny Ota", "reference": "Apocalypse 20:1-6", "section_fr": "La doctrine des choses dernières", "section_mg": "Ny fampianarana momba ny farany"}, {"number": 28, "title_fr": "28. La nouvelle terre", "title_mg": "28. Ny Tany Vaovao", "reference": "2 Pierre 3:13 ; Apocalypse 21:1-7", "section_fr": "La doctrine des choses dernières", "section_mg": "Ny fampianarana momba ny farany"}]'::jsonb,
